{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_qiyana": {
        "attack": "【附加包】挥环攻击。<#ff9028ff>凌人贵气<>：对每个敌人<#ffb900ff>10秒<>内的首次命中额外造成<#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<>物理伤害。武器附有元素时攻速+25%，攻击额外造成<#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#a974ffff>25%<>魔法伤害。",
        "skill": "【附加包】挥环横扫前方，造成<#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>110%<>物理伤害。消耗元素：河流<#ef5350ff>定身<><#ffb900ff>0.5秒<>后减速25%；岩石对生命低于50%的敌人额外造成<#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<>；草丛伪装<#ffb900ff>2.5秒<>并加速25%。",
        "skill2": "【附加包】突进到敌人身上，造成<#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<>物理伤害；<#ff9028ff>方圆塑令<>按身边地形附上元素：草丛选草丛，墙选岩石，河道选河流；身边都没有就按局势选（自己残血草丛，残血英雄岩石，其他英雄河流，野怪小兵岩石）；并刷新以绪塔尔之锋。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_qiyana": {
        "attack": "【附加包】揮環攻擊。<#ff9028ff>皇家特權<>：對每個敵人<#ffb900ff>10秒<>內的首次命中額外造成<#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<>物理傷害。武器附有元素時攻速+25%，攻擊額外造成<#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#a974ffff>25%<>魔法傷害。",
        "skill": "【附加包】揮環橫掃前方，造成<#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>110%<>物理傷害。消耗元素：河流<#ef5350ff>定身<><#ffb900ff>0.5秒<>後緩速25%；岩石對生命低於50%的敵人額外造成<#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<>；草叢偽裝<#ffb900ff>2.5秒<>並加速25%。",
        "skill2": "【附加包】突進到敵人身上，造成<#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<>物理傷害；<#ff9028ff>元素之形<>依身邊地形附上元素：草叢選草叢，牆選岩石，河道選河流；身邊都沒有就依局勢選（自己殘血草叢，殘血英雄岩石，其他英雄河流，野怪小兵岩石）；並刷新伊克斯塔爾迴旋刀。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_qiyana": {
        "attack": "[Add-on] A swing of her ring blade. <#ff9028ff>Royal Privilege<>: her first hit on each enemy within <#ffb900ff>10s<> deals <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<> physical damage more. While her ring holds an element she has +25% attack speed and her attacks deal <#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#a974ffff>25%<> magic damage more.",
        "skill": "[Add-on] Sweeps the ring through the enemies before her for <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>110%<> physical damage, spending her element: river <#ef5350ff>roots<> for <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> then slows 25%; rock deals <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<> more to enemies under 50% health; grass camouflages her for <#ffb900ff>2.5s<> with +25% move speed.",
        "skill2": "[Add-on] Dashes onto an enemy for <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<> physical damage. <#ff9028ff>Terrashape<> takes the element from the terrain beside her: brush gives grass, a wall rock, the river river; with none near, the fight picks: grass when she is low, rock on a wounded champion, a monster or a minion, river on any other champion; Edge of Ixtal refreshed."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_qiyana": {
        "attack": "[확장] 고리 칼날로 공격. <#ff9028ff>왕가의 특권<>: 적마다 <#ffb900ff>10초<> 안의 첫 적중이 <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<> 물리 피해 추가. 무기에 원소가 깃들면 공격 속도 +25%, 공격이 <#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#a974ffff>25%<> 마법 피해 추가.",
        "skill": "[확장] 고리로 앞쪽을 베어 <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>110%<> 물리 피해, 원소 소모: 강 <#ffb900ff>0.5초<> <#ef5350ff>속박<> 후 25% 둔화, 바위 체력 50% 미만의 적에게 <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<> 추가, 풀숲 <#ffb900ff>2.5초<> 위장과 이동 속도 +25%.",
        "skill2": "[확장] 적에게 돌진해 <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<> 물리 피해. <#ff9028ff>대지창조<>가 주변 지형으로 원소 선택: 풀숲은 풀숲, 벽은 바위, 강은 강; 주변에 없으면 상황에 따라: 위험하면 풀숲, 약한 챔피언·몬스터·미니언에 바위, 다른 챔피언에 강; 이쉬탈의 칼날 초기화."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_qiyana": {
        "attack": "【拡張】リングで攻撃。<#ff9028ff>女帝の威風<>：敵ごとに<#ffb900ff>10秒<>以内の最初の命中が<#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<>の物理ダメージを追加。武器にエレメントがある間、攻撃速度+25%、攻撃が<#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#a974ffff>25%<>の魔法ダメージを追加。",
        "skill": "【拡張】リングで前方を薙ぎ<#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>110%<>の物理ダメージ、エレメントを消費：川は<#ffb900ff>0.5秒<><#ef5350ff>スネア<>後25%スロウ、岩は体力50%未満の敵に<#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<>追加、草むらは<#ffb900ff>2.5秒<>迷彩と移動速度+25%。",
        "skill2": "【拡張】敵へ突進し<#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<>の物理ダメージ。<#ff9028ff>大地の力<>が近くの地形でエレメントを選ぶ：草むらは草むら、壁は岩、川は川。近くに無ければ状況で：危ない時は草むら、弱った敵や中立・ミニオンには岩、他のチャンピオンには川。イシュタルの切先も再使用可能に。"
      }
    }
  }
}
